    {
      "id": "summer-p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "时间跳到 1971 年夏天。"
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "location",
              "id": "lauras-room"
            },
            "label": "房间"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 仍保留熟悉的结构，但电话、录音和窗外的远景不断制造不安；同一个空间开始像一份被反复覆盖的案卷。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Time jumps to summer 1971. The "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "location",
              "id": "lauras-room"
            },
            "label": "room"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " keeps its familiar layout, while the telephone, recordings, and distant view beyond the window make the setting increasingly uneasy."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "minor",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-seasons-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "summer-p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "这一段记忆把房间与 "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "rusty-lake"
            },
            "label": "Rusty Lake"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 的意象联系得更紧。线索不再只指向 Laura 的日常生活，而开始暗示某件已经发生或即将发生的暴力事件。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "This memory pulls the room closer to the imagery of "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "rusty-lake"
            },
            "label": "Rusty Lake"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". The clues no longer point only to Laura’s everyday life; they begin to suggest a violent event surrounding her."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "minor",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-seasons-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "summer-p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "与春天一样，记忆通过 "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "black-cube"
            },
            "label": "黑色方块"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 被封存。重复的结构让玩家逐渐明白：每个季节既是独立片段，也是同一事件被不同时间切面重新照亮的结果。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "As in spring, the memory is sealed through a "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "black-cube"
            },
            "label": "black cube"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". The repeated structure makes each season feel both self-contained and part of one event illuminated from different points in time."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "minor",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-seasons-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
